{"id": "spec_qa_011", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["no_answer"], "tags": ["a1", "out_of_domain"], "no_answer": {"sources_checked": ["O-RAN.WG2.A1AP", "O-RAN.WG3.E2AP", "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "O-RAN.WG1.TS.OAD", "3GPP TS 38.300", "3GPP TS 38.331", "3GPP TS 28.552", "3GPP TS 38.413", "O-RAN.WG3.E2GAP", "3GPP TS 32.425", "O-RAN.WG2.TS.A1TD", "O-RAN ALLIANCE Overview"], "missing_evidence": "No document mentions Bitcoin or cryptocurrency mining; the only 'crypto' match is 'cryptographically'. A1AP, A1TD and OAD define A1 services (policy, enrichment information, ML model management), none of which is mining."}}
{"id": "spec_qa_012", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["no_answer"], "tags": ["e2", "near_miss"], "no_answer": {"sources_checked": ["O-RAN.WG2.A1AP", "O-RAN.WG3.E2AP", "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "O-RAN.WG1.TS.OAD", "3GPP TS 38.300", "3GPP TS 38.331", "3GPP TS 28.552", "3GPP TS 38.413", "O-RAN.WG3.E2GAP", "3GPP TS 32.425", "O-RAN.WG2.TS.A1TD", "O-RAN ALLIANCE Overview"], "missing_evidence": "E2AP, E2GAP and E2SM-KPM never mention 6G or NTN, and no document defines E2 beam steering measurements. Near misses: E2SM-KPM defines beam-level measurements, 3GPP TS 38.300/38.331 describe NTN outside E2, and the O-RAN Overview mentions 6G only as research work."}}
{"id": "spec_qa_013", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["difficult"], "tags": ["e2sm_kpm", "kpi", "units"], "evidence": [{"claim": "E2SM-KPM replaces the 3GPP unit Mbit with Kbit for DL Cell PDCP SDU Data Volume (DRB.PdcpSduVolumeDL_Filter).", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "version": "08.00", "sha256": "174c856f804c7af10310be03ecd9879e0c27998c26dea5282624df6fae6dc8b7", "clause": "7.9.1", "title": "Changes in the units of measurements while adopting for E2SM-KPM", "docx_heading": "7.9.1 Changes in the units of measurements while adopting for E2SM-KPM"}]}, {"claim": "The change prevents INTEGER values from being reported as 0 due to rounding.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "version": "08.00", "sha256": "174c856f804c7af10310be03ecd9879e0c27998c26dea5282624df6fae6dc8b7", "clause": "7.9.1", "title": "Changes in the units of measurements while adopting for E2SM-KPM", "docx_heading": "7.9.1 Changes in the units of measurements while adopting for E2SM-KPM"}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_014", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["direct"], "tags": ["e2sm_kpm", "e2", "event_trigger"], "evidence": [{"claim": "Style 1 is Periodic Report, based on a reporting period, for REPORT styles 1-5 and 255.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "version": "08.00", "sha256": "174c856f804c7af10310be03ecd9879e0c27998c26dea5282624df6fae6dc8b7", "clause": "7.3.1", "title": "Event Trigger Style Types", "docx_heading": "7.3.1 Event Trigger Style Types"}]}, {"claim": "Style 2 is Measurement Event, based on conditions on subscribed measurements, for REPORT styles 1-5.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "version": "08.00", "sha256": "174c856f804c7af10310be03ecd9879e0c27998c26dea5282624df6fae6dc8b7", "clause": "7.3.1", "title": "Event Trigger Style Types", "docx_heading": "7.3.1 Event Trigger Style Types"}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_015", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["multi_clause", "difficult"], "tags": ["e2sm_kpm", "kpi", "throughput", "cross_spec"], "evidence": [{"claim": "E2SM-KPM per-UE throughput uses the 3GPP formula restricted to the individual UE.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "version": "08.00", "sha256": "174c856f804c7af10310be03ecd9879e0c27998c26dea5282624df6fae6dc8b7", "clause": "7.9.0", "title": "Conversion of measurement definitions", "docx_heading": "7.9.0 Conversion of measurement definitions"}]}, {"claim": "The 3GPP average DL UE throughput is sum(ThpVolDl)/sum(ThpTimeDl) x 1000 kbit/s, or 0 when sum(ThpTimeDl) is 0.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 28.552", "version": "18.7.0", "sha256": "9785644b0c5a3060ced870ba3470ea3f02212262d518b2b919b1c40ec0e9b5b6", "clause": "5.1.1.3.1", "title": "Average DL UE throughput in gNB", "pdf_page": 49}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_016", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["difficult"], "tags": ["nr", "beam", "mobility"], "evidence": [{"claim": "Beam failure is declared when beam failure instance indications reach a configured threshold before a configured timer expires.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.300", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "058188999eb469ae95097a3b29b3abd24e65470a10f60d9d8965f7610c0de8f1", "clause": "9.2.8", "title": "Beam failure detection and recovery", "pdf_page": 112}]}, {"claim": "On PCell beam failure the UE initiates Random Access on the PCell and selects a suitable beam, prioritising beams with dedicated RA resources.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.300", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "058188999eb469ae95097a3b29b3abd24e65470a10f60d9d8965f7610c0de8f1", "clause": "9.2.8", "title": "Beam failure detection and recovery", "pdf_page": 112}]}, {"claim": "PCell beam failure recovery completes when the Random Access procedure completes.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.300", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "058188999eb469ae95097a3b29b3abd24e65470a10f60d9d8965f7610c0de8f1", "clause": "9.2.8", "title": "Beam failure detection and recovery", "pdf_page": 112}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_017", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["multi_clause"], "tags": ["rrc", "rlf", "timer"], "evidence": [{"claim": "T310 starts after N310 consecutive out-of-sync indications for the SpCell.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.331", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "939befcf81d76ee493a45d8c9a47d32b0863bb0941a7b3ecf63f5907cf61ea3e", "clause": "5.3.10.1", "title": "Detection of physical layer problems in RRC_CONNECTED", "pdf_page": 187}]}, {"claim": "T310 stops after N311 consecutive in-sync indications while running.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.331", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "939befcf81d76ee493a45d8c9a47d32b0863bb0941a7b3ecf63f5907cf61ea3e", "clause": "5.3.10.2", "title": "Recovery of physical layer problems", "pdf_page": 187}]}, {"claim": "T310 expiry in the PCell means MCG radio link failure is detected.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.331", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "939befcf81d76ee493a45d8c9a47d32b0863bb0941a7b3ecf63f5907cf61ea3e", "clause": "5.3.10.3", "title": "Detection of radio link failure", "pdf_page": 188}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_018", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["no_answer"], "tags": ["e2", "near_miss", "missing_spec"], "no_answer": {"sources_checked": ["O-RAN.WG2.A1AP", "O-RAN.WG3.E2AP", "O-RAN.WG3.TS.E2SM-KPM", "O-RAN.WG1.TS.OAD", "3GPP TS 38.300", "3GPP TS 38.331", "3GPP TS 28.552", "3GPP TS 38.413", "O-RAN.WG3.E2GAP", "3GPP TS 32.425", "O-RAN.WG2.TS.A1TD", "O-RAN ALLIANCE Overview"], "missing_evidence": "E2SM-RC, which defines RAN control styles and actions, is not in the corpus. E2AP clause 8.2.4 defines only the generic RIC Control procedure, E2SM-KPM clause 7.6 (CONTROL service styles) is Void, and 'handover' appears in E2AP and E2SM-KPM only as notation examples."}}
{"id": "spec_qa_019", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["multi_clause"], "tags": ["architecture", "latency", "near_rt_ric", "cross_spec"], "evidence": [{"claim": "Typical loop times: Non-RT 1 s or more, Near-RT about 10 ms or more, E2 Node below 10 ms.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG1.TS.OAD", "version": "14.00", "sha256": "6399390ac5fc2595b1d37e43770ccc3eb5dce72af69c708ce6a25d1873072f5d", "clause": "5.2", "title": "O-RAN control loops", "pdf_page": 16}]}, {"claim": "The E2 interface supports near-real-time latency from 10 ms up to 1 s.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.E2GAP", "version": "04.01", "sha256": "722c80f9dffb5dbd1b2239883f4c608089ea25832070b2e3290ed8a6eb53eb38", "clause": "5.1.1", "title": "E2 Interface Requirements", "pdf_page": 9}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_020", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["difficult"], "tags": ["ngap", "handover", "failure", "troubleshooting"], "evidence": [{"claim": "On TNGRELOCprep expiry the source NG-RAN node initiates the Handover Cancel procedure with an appropriate cause.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.413", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "83653aad40d34884b4e886887b8f6aa60b03bb13da42db3a6715ece218612d3a", "clause": "8.4.1.3", "title": "Unsuccessful Operation", "pdf_page": 68}]}, {"claim": "If the target or 5GC cannot accept, the AMF sends HANDOVER PREPARATION FAILURE with a cause value.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "3GPP TS 38.413", "version": "18.1.0", "sha256": "83653aad40d34884b4e886887b8f6aa60b03bb13da42db3a6715ece218612d3a", "clause": "8.4.1.3", "title": "Unsuccessful Operation", "pdf_page": 68}]}]}
{"id": "spec_qa_021", "status": "approved", "reviewer": "tanzim10", "reviewed_on": "2026-10-14", "families": ["multi_clause", "difficult"], "tags": ["e2", "procedure", "failure", "troubleshooting"], "evidence": [{"claim": "An unknown RAN Function ID IE leads to RIC SUBSCRIPTION FAILURE with a cause value.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.E2AP", "version": "04.00", "sha256": "03a20214920bba7dba5d2237e976e7501d81c895afcdf3081b3a1b0067ba2a55", "clause": "8.2.1.4", "title": "Abnormal Conditions", "pdf_page": 15}]}, {"claim": "On TRICEVENTcreate expiry the Near-RT RIC initiates RIC Subscription Delete with the same RIC Request ID and ignores late replies.", "alternatives": [{"spec_id": "O-RAN.WG3.E2AP", "version": "04.00", "sha256": "03a20214920bba7dba5d2237e976e7501d81c895afcdf3081b3a1b0067ba2a55", "clause": "8.2.1.3", "title": "Unsuccessful Operation", "pdf_page": 15}]}]}
